# Phase 3.2 demonstration: bounded infusions (OVER) and interactions with REPEAT doses.
# * dopamine runs 8 mg/hr for 10 hr (80 mg) -> counted statically against MAX_TOTAL 150 mg
# * a heparin REPEAT dose and the dopamine infusion interact; their combined peak is
#   exactly the INTERACTION limit (8 + 12 = 20 mg/hr), proven at compile time.
PATIENT p1 { WEIGHT: 70 kg; }
DRUG dopamine { MAX_RATE: 20 mg/hr; MAX_TOTAL: 150 mg; }
DRUG heparin  { MAX_RATE: 15 mg/hr; }

INTERACTION dopamine WITH heparin LIMIT 20 mg/hr;

INFUSION base FOR p1 USING dopamine AT 8 mg/hr OVER 10 hr;
REPEAT bolus  FOR p1 USING heparin AT 12 mg/hr EVERY 6 hr UNTIL 12 hr OVER 1 hr;
